WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Hi, I'm Chris Ward.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.000
Meet your trainer. It sets you up and gets you running.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.500
Add more agents only when you're ready.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.500
Answer a few questions, pick your trainer, and we set you up.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.000
You stay in charge. We never ask for passwords.
